    {
      "file": "course-app/content/hsk2/lesson-11.json",
      "sha256": "01ec965d7f18d41c5c91c053f93544b24c971303ed8b4ca6afd2ad2c03d48ff8",
      "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l11",
      "source": {
        "startPdfPage": 108,
        "endPdfPage": 116,
        "startPrintedPage": 93,
        "endPrintedPage": 101
      },
      "texts": [
        {
          "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l11:text1",
          "audioTrack": "11-1",
          "lines": [
            {
              "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l11:text1:line1",
              "zh": "家月，都下课了，你怎么还不回家？",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 109,
                "printedPage": 94,
                "section": "课文1",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l11:text1:line2",
              "zh": "我头疼，不太舒服。",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 109,
                "printedPage": 94,
                "section": "课文1",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l11:text1:line3",
              "zh": "你这几天经常头疼，去医院看看吧。",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 109,
                "printedPage": 94,
                "section": "课文1",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l11:text1:line4",
              "zh": "我想休息一下，现在不能动，一动就疼。",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 109,
                "printedPage": 94,
                "section": "课文1",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l11:text1:line5",
              "zh": "那你在这儿坐着，我去开车，一会儿送你去医院。",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 109,
                "printedPage": 94,
                "section": "课文1",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l11:text1:line6",
              "zh": "谢谢王老师。",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 109,
                "printedPage": 94,
                "section": "课文1",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l11:text2",
          "audioTrack": "11-3",
          "lines": [
            {
              "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l11:text2:line1",
              "zh": "现在路上车多，还下着雪，我开慢一点儿。",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 111,
                "printedPage": 96,
                "section": "课文2",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l11:text2:line2",
              "zh": "没问题，现在头没那么疼了。",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 111,
                "printedPage": 96,
                "section": "课文2",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l11:text2:line3",
              "zh": "好。李文来电话了，你帮我接一下。",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 111,
                "printedPage": 96,
                "section": "课文2",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l11:text2:line4",
              "zh": "喂，李文，王老师开着车呢，你找她有事吗？",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 111,
                "printedPage": 96,
                "section": "课文2",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l11:text2:line5",
              "zh": "没什么事。今天雪这么大，你们开车去哪儿啊？",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 111,
                "printedPage": 96,
                "section": "课文2",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l11:text2:line6",
              "zh": "去医院，我头有点儿疼。",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 111,
                "printedPage": 96,
                "section": "课文2",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l11:text2:line7",
              "zh": "那我一会儿去看看你。",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 111,
                "printedPage": 96,
                "section": "课文2",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l11:text3",
          "audioTrack": "11-5",
          "lines": [
            {
              "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l11:text3:line1",
              "zh": "李文，快请进！",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 113,
                "printedPage": 98,
                "section": "课文3",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l11:text3:line2",
              "zh": "家月，你怎么样了？头还疼吗？",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 113,
                "printedPage": 98,
                "section": "课文3",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l11:text3:line3",
              "zh": "不那么疼了。医生开了一些药，吃完就好多了。",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 113,
                "printedPage": 98,
                "section": "课文3",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l11:text3:line4",
              "zh": "那就好！",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 113,
                "printedPage": 98,
                "section": "课文3",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l11:text3:line5",
              "zh": "家月，你想不想吃点儿东西？",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 113,
                "printedPage": 98,
                "section": "课文3",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l11:text3:line6",
              "zh": "吃点儿吧，身体不舒服时更要好好吃饭。",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 113,
                "printedPage": 98,
                "section": "课文3",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l11:text3:line7",
              "zh": "吃点儿什么呢？",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 113,
                "printedPage": 98,
                "section": "课文3",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l11:text3:line8",
              "zh": "你最喜欢吃中国菜，我做几个中国菜吧。",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 113,
                "printedPage": 98,
                "section": "课文3",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l11:text3:line9",
              "zh": "好的，谢谢王老师。",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 113,
                "printedPage": 98,
                "section": "课文3",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l11:text4",
          "audioTrack": "11-7",
          "lines": [
            {
              "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l11:text4:line1",
              "zh": "我这几天经常头疼，从药店买了点儿药，没去医院。今天下课后，王老师看我不舒服，就送我去医院了。从医院回来，李文也来看我了。现在他们都回去了，我也要睡觉了。",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 114,
                "printedPage": 99,
                "section": "课文4",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "vocabulary": [
        {
